{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DAMN Gravity!</strong> is a vertical rage platformer where one bad jump can ruin your whole evening. No checkpoints. No saves. Just you, a mountain of regret, and the pull of gravity always bringing you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/1f7a06b054fd9386590c8d77eeb092cf.poster.avif?t=1767938454\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/1f7a06b054fd9386590c8d77eeb092cf.webm?t=1767938454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb a vertical nightmare using momentum-based movement and master the intentionally janky controls. Navigate pallets that are not OSHA-approved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/5e5425f9ca7c3eba8fb51a5ed57b7a4c.poster.avif?t=1767938454\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/5e5425f9ca7c3eba8fb51a5ed57b7a4c.webm?t=1767938454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your parachute. You only get one. Use it wisely... or waste it spectacularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/635983aa24fb5b97520cfdaf5dc3a098.poster.avif?t=1767938454\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/635983aa24fb5b97520cfdaf5dc3a098.webm?t=1767938454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch skyward on some suspiciously bouncy beds and pray you stick the landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/11a5e962e5003720bfbe6ce9a993e0fe.poster.avif?t=1767938454\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/extras/11a5e962e5003720bfbe6ce9a993e0fe.webm?t=1767938454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm, stay focused, and when you\u2019re back at the bottom again... Smile. That\u2019s personal growth. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEAM DECK USERS: The developer does not recommend purchasing if you plan on playing exclusively on the STEAM DECK. If you do play on the STEAM DECK, limit the frame rate to 30 FPS. Once in-game, open the pause menu, select &quot;Graphics Settings&quot; and set to LOW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: \u201cGold Coast\u201d by Jens Kiilstofte</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under: CC BY 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Source: Machinima Sound </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903200?t=1767938454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/dbd74fe8edd2da0f965e524ce76bdf46a2071e2e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767938454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903200/3a